	(text "Zine Machine main board v3 (bancouver40_pb2) - generated by tools/zm_v3/gen_sch.py from design.py; edit design.py and regenerate.\nBlocks: PocketBeagle 2 Industrial (face-down on its 3.55 mm sockets) + 4.58in RGB565 bar panel; 43 Choc v1 keys read by the\nCortex-M4F through six 74HC165 (CLK P1.26, SH/LD P1.28, QH P2.05); FE1.1s hub on USB1 -> 2 rear USB-A; IP5306 1S charger/boost\nwith a DPDT slide switch (P-FET on +5V_SYS + one KEY press); ES8388 codec (I2S master) -> headset TRRS + line-out TRS.\nSoftware: header pins with two balls (P1.04/06/12/26/28, P2.01/03/05/07/09/11) - mux only the ball named here, keep the twin an input."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
